Focus thermal energy and strike an enemy for [117%, 144%, 166%, 184%, 200% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as cold.

A burst of cold will then engulf them, doing an extra [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Cold damage and also freeze them for [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

If the attack freezes a pinned creature a burst of ice is summoned, circling the caster and the creature with a wall of ice for 3 turns.

The cold burst damage will scale with your Mindpower.
